    <briefdescription>
<para>Matches patterns for <computeroutput>vscale</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This can either be a call to <computeroutput>llvm.vscale</computeroutput> or the constant expression <computeroutput>ptrtoint(gep &lt;vscale x 1 x i8&gt;, &lt;vscale x 1 x i8&gt;* null, i32 1&gt;</computeroutput> under the right conditions determined by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_data_layout" kindref="compound">DataLayout</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
